OL,3,GNEWSAGarth Brooks adds extra Belfast
OL,4,Adate as two shows sell out
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican country music star Garth
OL,7,FBrooks has added an extra Belfast date
OL,8,Fto his 2027 tour after his two original
OL,9,Fshows in the city sold out.
OL,11,FThe new date, an outdoor concert at
OL,12,FBoucher Playing Fields, will take place
OL,13,Fon 23 May.
OL,15,FBrooks will also play two gigs at the
OL,16,Fsame location on 21 and 22 May 2027.
OL,17,FThe gigs will be the first time he has
OL,18,Fperformed in Belfast since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
