OL,3,GNEWSAGarth Brooks adds extra Belfast
OL,4,Adate as two shows sell out
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrooks' last gigs in the city were a
OL,7,Ffive-night run at the King's Hall in
OL,8,FNovember 1998, after which he said the
OL,9,Freaction from fans left his ears
OL,10,F"ringing for three days".
